sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as Spring Container
    participant DSC as DataSourceConfiguration
    participant DSP as DataSourceProperties
    participant FW as Flyway
    participant DB as Database

    SC->>DSC: invoke migrate method via PostConstruct
    Note right of SC: Executed after bean initialization

    activate DSC
    DSC->>DSP: retrieve all configured data sources
    activate DSP
    DSP-->>DSC: Map[String, DataSourceConfig]
    Note right of DSP: All tenant datasource configurations
    deactivate DSP

    Note right of DSC: Iterate over datasource map entries
    loop for each data source
        DSC->>DSC: call migrateDataSource for each source
        Note right of DSC: tenantName: String (tenant identifier) config: DataSourceConfig (datasource configuration)

        DSC->>FW: configure Flyway with data source
        Note right of DSC: dataSource: DataSource (tenant datasource)
        activate FW

        FW->>DB: execute migration scripts
        Note right of FW: Runs SQL migration files
        activate DB

        DB-->>FW: migration complete
        Note right of DB: MigrateResult (Migration execution result)
        deactivate DB

        FW-->>DSC: return migration result
        deactivate FW
    end

    deactivate DSC